{
  "name": "regressionledger",
  "version": "0.10.0",
  "description": "Stop your coding agent from resurrecting fixes that already failed. A zero-dependency Claude Code hook + CLI that fingerprints every edit, links it to the test/build outcome, and HARD-BLOCKS the agent from re-applying a patch that previously failed — across sessions, surviving context compaction.",
